371 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The final selected idea for the project is a cloud-based smart irrigation system that combines IoT sensors, weather forecasting, and a machine learning model to optimize water usage in agriculture. The system monitors soil moisture levels in real-time and uses weather data to make intelligent decisions about when to irrigate. A user-friendly website allows farmers to remotely monitor and control the system, and additional features which can be integrated like NPK and pH sensors help manage soil health and fertilizer usage.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
